  "method": "Manually selected settled hardware windows; Hann FFT local peaks around expected oscillator families and four lower-saw harmonics. Two-ms RMS at 1-ms hops in 300\u20135000 Hz supplies independent energy gate evidence. No engine audio or DSP fitting.",
